CBoard is an ncurses frontend to GNU Chess. Only version 5.07 of GNU Chess has
been tested to work. Other versions might work, but I haven't tested them.
Support for other engines is planned.

Only version 5.1 has been tested to work with CBoard. Other versions might
work, or might not.

Read INSTALL for build and installation details. After installing, type
"cboard -h" for command-line options or just "cboard". Then type F1 for
in-game command keys.

Send a description of any bugs you find along with the associated .pgn (if
any) and feature requests to the address below.

